{"seq":2,"slug":"price-gouging-collusion","title":"哄抬/串通价格识别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-price-compliance-patrol/fake-discount-price-rule/price-gouging-collusion","wordCount":3325,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"哄抬-串通价格识别\">哄抬/串通价格识别</h1><p>上面几类巡检面对的是单条报价的错误。这一篇面对的是<strong>多主体协调的价格行为</strong>：一场危机期间防疫用品集体涨到同一价位，一群卖家在同一小时内把同类目价格齐步上调，一个卖家把成本不相关的商品在需求冲击时抬到十倍。这类行为的判定对象不是价格数值本身，而是<strong>价格变化在主体之间的同步性</strong>——它需要把视角从「一条报价」抬高到「一组报价的时间序列」。</p>\n<p>本文处理三类判定的识别侧：反竞争的<strong>价格串通</strong>（横向协议）、危机情形下的<strong>哄抬价格</strong>（excessive pricing / price gouging）、以及算法定价导致的<strong>默示协调</strong>。这些判定的法律后果最严重，因此对证据质量的要求也最高——本文输出的是<strong>线索</strong>，其处置路径必须经过法务而非自动冻结。价格合规巡检的确定性护栏见 <a href=\"../abnormal-price-detect/zero-extreme-price-detect\">0元/极端异常价识别</a>，折扣依据审查见 <a href=\"reference-price-history-basis\">划线价历史依据校验</a>，本文的边界是<strong>多主体价格的同步性判定与线索生成</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>横向价格固定的法律定义比工程直觉宽得多。美国联邦贸易委员会的表述是：价格固定是竞争者之间<strong>就提高、降低、维持或稳定价格或价格水平达成的协议</strong>（书面、口头或从行为推断），且竞争者之间约定价格本身就几乎总是违法，无论价格被规定在最低、最高还是某个区间；协议可以从「间接证据」中被发现——例如直接竞争者之间存在无法解释的相同合同条款或价格行为模式，且缺乏正当的独立商业解释（<a href=\"https://www.ftc.gov/advice-guidance/competition-guidance/guide-antitrust-laws/dealings-competitors/price-fixing\">FTC, Price Fixing</a>）。同样关键的是它给出的反例：<strong>价格相同或同时变动并不必然是协议的结果</strong>，大宗商品因为产品几乎同质本来就价格相同，农业品价格随共同的市场条件同涨同跌。</p>\n<p>这条反例是所有串通检测系统的核心约束：<strong>同步性是必要条件而非充分条件</strong>。把它误当成充分条件，会产生大量指向正常市场行为（跟价竞争、季节性同涨、共同成本冲击）的假线索，而这类线索的成本极高——一次错误的串通指控对被指方的商业伤害远大于一次漏检。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>观察量</th>\n<th>强证据特征</th>\n<th>主要替代解释</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>价格同步上涨</td>\n<td>卖家间涨价的时滞分布</td>\n<td>时滞集中且极短</td>\n<td>跟价策略、共同成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价位点收敛</td>\n<td>涨价后价位的离散度</td>\n<td>收敛到同一非价格点</td>\n<td>心理定价、价格锚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>周期性同调</td>\n<td>调价时点的分布</td>\n<td>非价格事件触发</td>\n<td>平台统一活动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构一致性</td>\n<td>各卖家价格树</td>\n<td>折扣结构逐层相同</td>\n<td>复制公开价目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>沟通痕迹</td>\n<td>外部证据</td>\n<td>直接协议证据</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"算法定价与默示协调\">算法定价与默示协调</h3><p>当定价由算法完成时，协调可能不需要任何沟通——多个卖家使用同一家第三方定价服务，或使用结构相同、都以「对手价格」为输入的算法，就能形成经济学家称为<strong>默契协同</strong>的均衡。这类情形在法律上仍未完全定型，但监管关注的方向是明确的：判定重点落在<strong>算法是否以竞争对手的非公开价格信号作为输入</strong>、以及卖家是否明知这种结构性后果仍接入。工程上的可检测信号是：一小组卖家的调价时间戳呈现出无法用各自业务日历解释的相关性，且这组卖家的价格存在共同的结构性特征。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[多主体调价事件流] --&gt; B[按品类 x 规格 分组]&#10;  B --&gt; C[构造价格时序矩阵]&#10;  C --&gt; D{同向变动时滞 &lt; T_sync?}&#10;  D --&gt;|否| E[无信号]&#10;  D --&gt;|是| F[参与主体数 &gt;= N_min?]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| G[降级: 观察队列]&#10;  F --&gt;|是| H[检验共同外生因素]&#10;  H --&gt; I{成本/需求冲击可解释?}&#10;  I --&gt;|是| J[排除: 共同因素]&#10;  I --&gt;|否| K[检验价位收敛性]&#10;  K --&gt; L{收敛到非价格点?}&#10;  L --&gt;|是| M[生成线索: high]&#10;  L --&gt;|否| N[生成线索: medium]&#10;  M --&gt; O[法务复核队列&lt;br/&gt;禁止自动处置]&#10;  N --&gt; O\">flowchart TD\n  A[多主体调价事件流] --&gt; B[按品类 x 规格 分组]\n  B --&gt; C[构造价格时序矩阵]\n  C --&gt; D{同向变动时滞 &lt; T_sync?}\n  D --&gt;|否| E[无信号]\n  D --&gt;|是| F[参与主体数 &gt;= N_min?]\n  F --&gt;|否| G[降级: 观察队列]\n  F --&gt;|是| H[检验共同外生因素]\n  H --&gt; I{成本/需求冲击可解释?}\n  I --&gt;|是| J[排除: 共同因素]\n  I --&gt;|否| K[检验价位收敛性]\n  K --&gt; L{收敛到非价格点?}\n  L --&gt;|是| M[生成线索: high]\n  L --&gt;|否| N[生成线索: medium]\n  M --&gt; O[法务复核队列&lt;br/&gt;禁止自动处置]\n  N --&gt; O</pre><h3 id=\"为什么处置必须与检测分离\">为什么处置必须与检测分离</h3><p>串通识别与前面几类巡检在处置上有一个本质差异：<strong>不能自动冻结</strong>。理由有三层。第一层是错误成本不对称——误判一次串通的价格对商家商誉的影响远大于晚一天处置。第二层是证据要求——法律意义上的协议需要证据链，而统计同步性只是筛选工具，把筛选结果当证据是方法论上的错误。第三层是管辖——价格垄断的认定与处罚属于竞争法主管机关，平台的角色是提供线索与配合调查，不是自行认定。因此本文的所有输出都进入法务复核队列，且队列中的记录<strong>不带处置动作</strong>，只带可复核的统计量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"同步性与收敛性检验\">同步性与收敛性检验</h2><h3 id=\"同向变动时滞\">同向变动时滞</h3><p>设一组卖家 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = \\{1, \\dots, n\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，在观察窗口内每个卖家 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 有涨价事件序列 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>&lt;</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>…</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i^{(1)} &lt; t_i^{(2)} &lt; \\dots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3217em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3217em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.123em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span></span></span></span></span>。定义一个「同步簇」为一组卖方事件，其时间戳的两两最大间隔不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>sync</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{sync}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sync</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（实践中从数小时到一天），且方向相同。对每个同步簇计算：参与主体数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>cluster</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{\\text{cluster}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cluster</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、跨主体的时滞分布的集中度（用时滞的 MAD 与中位数之比度量）、以及涨价幅度的一致性。强信号的形状是<strong>时滞中位数极小、MAD 极小、幅度接近</strong>——即多个独立主体在同一短窗口内以近似相同的幅度涨价。</p>\n<p>这一判据的弱点是平台统一活动会造成完全相同的形态。因此每一簇必须在判定前过一次<strong>共同外生因素检验</strong>：该品类在此窗口内是否有平台级调价（活动开始、成本公告、汇率跳变、监管变动）。这个检验的可解释性依赖平台自身的事件日志，而事件日志的主数据在促销与活动系统一侧，巡检只做只读关联。</p>\n<h3 id=\"价位收敛性\">价位收敛性</h3><p>涨价的幅度一致还不足以说明问题，更有指向性的是<strong>涨价后的价位落点</strong>。独立决策的卖家即使同时受成本冲击，落点也会围绕各自原有的定价结构分散；而存在协调时，落点会收敛到一个由协调决定的点。度量方式是对簇内各卖家涨价后的价格取变异系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>σ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CV = \\sigma / \\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>，并与该品类基线同期的正常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CV</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 比较。若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CV</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 显著低于基线且落点不是一个显著的心理定价点（例如不落在 9.99、19.9 这类结构上），则收敛性判据成立。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>cluster</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>signal</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>baseline</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>cluster</mtext></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>baseline</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CV_{\\text{cluster}} = \\frac{\\sigma(p_i)}{\\mu(p_i)}, \\qquad \\text{signal} = \\frac{CV_{\\text{baseline}} - CV_{\\text{cluster}}}{CV_{\\text{baseline}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cluster</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">signal</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">baseline</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">baseline</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cluster</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>心理定价点需要通过数据得到而不是靠枚举：对品类内价格的小数部分做分布统计，出现频次显著高的尾数集合即为该品类的心理定价点，用它来排除正常收敛。这个尾数分布是品类级的静态特征，可以离线计算并缓存。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与跟价行为的区分\">与跟价行为的区分</h3><p>必须把串通与<strong>合法的跟价竞争</strong>分开，否则竞争本身会被当作违法。区分的要点在于<strong>方向的不对称与反应的滞后</strong>：跟价通常是被动的、有可观测的滞后（看到对手降价后再跟进），且方向上以「跟随降价」为主；串通则表现为主动的、几乎同时的、且以<strong>涨价</strong>为主的同向变动，尤其在成本未变的窗口内。另一个区分点是参与集合的稳定性——跟价者的对手关系随时间变化（今天跟 A，明天跟 B），而协调往往表现为一组稳定主体的重复共同行动。价格情报与自动调价的合法形态由相邻系统处理，巡检只消费其输出的事件流。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>跟价竞争</th>\n<th>疑似协调</th>\n<th>判据权重</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>方向</td>\n<td>以降为主</td>\n<td>以涨为主</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时滞</td>\n<td>可观测且有分布</td>\n<td>极短且集中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参与集合</td>\n<td>随时间变化</td>\n<td>稳定重复</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>触发</td>\n<td>对手降价事件</td>\n<td>无外生触发</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>幅度</td>\n<td>跟随至对手价位</td>\n<td>收敛至共同非价格点</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"哄抬价格的识别\">哄抬价格的识别</h2><h3 id=\"需求冲击下的价格行为\">需求冲击下的价格行为</h3><p>哄抬价格的核心不是价格高，而是<strong>在特定情形下（危机、短缺、需求冲击）把价格抬到与成本与风险无关的水平</strong>。它的判据结构与串通不同：它是单一主体对自身历史与成本的行为偏离，而非主体间的同步。可用的观察量包括：价格相对自身危机前水平的倍数、相对成本变化（若有成本数据）的倍数、以及涨价与需求信号（搜索量、缺货率、下单量）的时间关系。</p>\n<p>Google 的购物政策把「利用处于弱势或受胁迫情形的个人，利用其紧急需求或缺乏合理替代选择，索取显著高于市场通行水平的价格」明确列为价格剥削并归入 egregious 违规（<a href=\"https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/6150127\">Google Merchant Center, Misrepresentation</a>）。这意味着平台侧对这类行为存在直接的曝光治理手段，而不只是竞争法层面的责任。</p>\n<h3 id=\"危机窗口的定义\">危机窗口的定义</h3><p>「危机窗口」不能由巡检系统自行判断，否则会陷入「什么时候算危机」的争论。它应当是一个由治理侧显式声明、带生效与失效时刻的<strong>事件对象</strong>，巡检在其有效期内启用相应判据。判据的阈值也应随事件配置，而不是硬编码。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;event&quot;: &quot;supply_shock_2026_q3&quot;,&#10;  &quot;status&quot;: &quot;active&quot;,&#10;  &quot;declared_at&quot;: &quot;2026-08-14T00:00:00Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;expires_at&quot;: &quot;2026-11-30T23:59:59Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;scope&quot;: { &quot;markets&quot;: [&quot;DE&quot;, &quot;FR&quot;, &quot;US&quot;], &quot;categories&quot;: [&quot;medical_supply&quot;, &quot;water_filter&quot;] },&#10;  &quot;rules&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;id&quot;: &quot;PG-001&quot;, &quot;when&quot;: &quot;price / pre_event_median &gt;= 3.0&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;LEAD_HIGH&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;id&quot;: &quot;PG-002&quot;, &quot;when&quot;: &quot;price / pre_event_median &gt;= 1.5 AND cost_ratio &lt;= 1.2&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;LEAD_MEDIUM&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;id&quot;: &quot;PG-003&quot;, &quot;when&quot;: &quot;demand_spike AND price_rise_lag_hours &lt;= 6&quot;, &quot;weight&quot;: 2 }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;disposition&quot;: &quot;legal_review_only&quot;,&#10;  &quot;auto_freeze&quot;: false&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"event\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"supply_shock_2026_q3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"active\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"declared_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-08-14T00:00:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"expires_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-11-30T23:59:59Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"markets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"US\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"categories\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"medical_supply\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"water_filter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PG-001\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"price / pre_event_median >= 3.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"LEAD_HIGH\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PG-002\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"price / pre_event_median >= 1.5 AND cost_ratio &#x3C;= 1.2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"LEAD_MEDIUM\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PG-003\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"demand_spike AND price_rise_lag_hours &#x3C;= 6\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"disposition\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"legal_review_only\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"auto_freeze\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 危机期涨价线索（单主体，对比事件前基线与成本）&#10;WITH pre AS (&#10;  SELECT offer_id, percentile_cont(0.5) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY price) AS pre_median&#10;  FROM offer_price_change&#10;  WHERE effective_at &gt;= $1::timestamptz - interval &#39;60 days&#39;&#10;    AND effective_at &lt;  $1::timestamptz                  -- $1 = declared_at&#10;  GROUP BY offer_id&#10;),&#10;now_price AS (&#10;  SELECT DISTINCT ON (offer_id) offer_id, price AS cur_price, cost AS cur_cost&#10;  FROM offer_price_change&#10;  WHERE effective_at &gt;= $1::timestamptz&#10;  ORDER BY offer_id, effective_at DESC&#10;)&#10;SELECT n.offer_id, p.pre_median, n.cur_price,&#10;       n.cur_price / p.pre_median AS ratio,&#10;       n.cur_cost,&#10;       n.cur_price / nullif(n.cur_cost, 0) AS markup&#10;FROM now_price n JOIN pre p USING (offer_id)&#10;WHERE n.cur_price / p.pre_median &gt;= 1.5&#10;ORDER BY ratio DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 危机期涨价线索（单主体，对比事件前基线与成本）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pre </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> offer_id, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">percentile_cont</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITHIN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> price) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pre_median</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> offer_price_change</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> effective_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'60 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> effective_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                  -- $1 = declared_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> offer_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">now_price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (offer_id) offer_id, price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cur_price, cost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cur_cost</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> offer_price_change</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> effective_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> offer_id, effective_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">offer_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pre_median</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cur_price</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cur_price</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pre_median</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ratio,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cur_cost</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cur_price</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nullif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cur_cost</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> markup</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> now_price n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pre p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (offer_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cur_price</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pre_median</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ratio </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"成本不可得时的替代判据\">成本不可得时的替代判据</h3><p>当成本数据缺失时，只能退回到价格行为本身：倍率、涨价的突然性（单步跳变而非渐进）、以及与需求信号的时间邻近。这些判据的误报率明显更高——清仓与断货前的正常调价会长得很像——因此当成本缺失时严重度上限应被压到 medium，并强制走人工复核。把「没有成本证据」当作「没有违规」，或者当作「已经可以定性」，是两个方向相反的错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"线索的交付与边界\">线索的交付与边界</h2><h3 id=\"线索记录的最小内容\">线索记录的最小内容</h3><p>一条线索要能被法务与监管使用，至少需要：涉及的主体集合与各自的价格事件、同步簇的时间范围与各事件时间戳、幅度与落点统计、共同外生因素检验的结论与其依据、判据版本与阈值。缺少「共同外生因素已被排除」这一步的线索是不完整的，因为它是区分合法同涨与违法的关键论证。线索一旦生成即不可变，后续补充以追加记录的形式进行，这与 <a href=\"../price-patrol-governance/price-rule-version-audit\">巡检规则版本与审计</a> 中的不可变审计原则一致。</p>\n<h3 id=\"明确不做的事\">明确不做的事</h3><p>巡检系统不应做的事需要写清楚，避免实现时越界：不做法律定性（只做线索），不自动冻结（处置在法务复核之后，与 <a href=\"../patrol-task-enforce/price-freeze-delist-action\">价格冻结/下架处置</a> 的自动路径不同），不向被指方披露判据细节（避免被对抗性调整），不把统计同步性单独作为证据对外表述。最后一条尤其重要：一旦平台把「统计同步」表述为「串通」，平台自身就承担了错误的举证责任。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>串通判定的法律定义是「就提价/降价/维持/稳定价格达成的协议」，且可从行为推断；但价格相同或同时变动<strong>并不必然</strong>是协议的结果，同步性是必要而非充分条件。</li>\n<li>检测的角度是同步簇：参与主体数、时滞集中度、幅度一致性、以及涨价后的价位收敛性。</li>\n<li>每一簇必须先过共同外生因素检验（平台活动、成本冲击、汇率、监管变动），检验结论是线索的一部分。</li>\n<li>跟价竞争与协调的区分靠方向（涨 vs 降）、时滞分布、参与集合稳定性与是否有外生触发。</li>\n<li>哄抬价格的判据是单一主体在危机窗口内相对自身基线与成本的偏离；危机窗口必须由治理侧显式声明并带生效时刻。</li>\n<li>成本数据缺失时严重度上限压到 medium 并强制人工复核，不得把无证据当作已定性。</li>\n<li>全部输出进入法务复核队列，禁止自动处置、禁止向被指方披露判据细节、禁止把统计同步性对外表述为协议。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些线索与「依据审查」类违规走的是两条流水线：后者的处置是更正展示与商家整改，前者的处置是法务判断与配合监管。两条线的度量口径也不同，前者的量级很小但对准确性要求极高，因此它不参与 <a href=\"../price-patrol-governance/price-violation-trend\">价格违规趋势看板</a> 的常规违规率指标，而单列为准入类指标。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"哄抬/串通价格识别","id":"哄抬-串通价格识别"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"算法定价与默示协调","id":"算法定价与默示协调"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么处置必须与检测分离","id":"为什么处置必须与检测分离"},{"level":2,"text":"同步性与收敛性检验","id":"同步性与收敛性检验"},{"level":3,"text":"同向变动时滞","id":"同向变动时滞"},{"level":3,"text":"价位收敛性","id":"价位收敛性"},{"level":3,"text":"与跟价行为的区分","id":"与跟价行为的区分"},{"level":2,"text":"哄抬价格的识别","id":"哄抬价格的识别"},{"level":3,"text":"需求冲击下的价格行为","id":"需求冲击下的价格行为"},{"level":3,"text":"危机窗口的定义","id":"危机窗口的定义"},{"level":3,"text":"成本不可得时的替代判据","id":"成本不可得时的替代判据"},{"level":2,"text":"线索的交付与边界","id":"线索的交付与边界"},{"level":3,"text":"线索记录的最小内容","id":"线索记录的最小内容"},{"level":3,"text":"明确不做的事","id":"明确不做的事"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"划线价历史依据校验（联动119）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-price-compliance-patrol/fake-discount-price-rule/reference-price-history-basis"},"next":{"title":"各市场价格法规规则巡检","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-price-compliance-patrol/fake-discount-price-rule/market-price-rule-patrol"}}